{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55040","headline":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军梦，天上作雷鸣。\n破敌勤（辛本、川本、京本作「擒」）王有（京本作「看」）此兆，无（京本作「不」）拘明（辛本、川本、京本作「月」）暗与阴晴，拥（京本作「勇」）士向前程（京本作「征」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}